.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH MERMAN-CLI-RENDER 1 2026-08-15 "Merman 0.8.0-alpha.5" "Merman CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
merman\-cli\-render \- Render one Mermaid diagram with Merman\*(Aqs native interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmerman\-cli render\fR [\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-output\fR] [\fB\-\-input\-kind\fR] [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-\-svg\-pipeline\fR] [\fB\-b\fR|\fB\-\-background\fR] [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-css\-file\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-s\fR|\fB\-\-scale\fR] [\fB\-\-raster\-fit\-width\fR] [\fB\-\-raster\-fit\-height\fR] [\fB\-\-raster\-max\-width\fR] [\fB\-\-raster\-max\-height\fR] [\fB\-\-raster\-max\-pixels\fR] [\fB\-\-raster\-unbounded\fR] [\fB\-\-pdf\-filter\-scale\fR] [\fB\-\-pdf\-max\-filter\-image\-pixels\fR] [\fB\-\-pdf\-filter\-images\-unbounded\fR] [\fB\-\-embedded\-image\-max\-bytes\fR] [\fB\-\-embedded\-image\-max\-total\-bytes\fR] [\fB\-\-embedded\-image\-max\-pixels\fR] [\fB\-\-embedded\-image\-max\-total\-pixels\fR] [\fB\-\-embedded\-images\-unbounded\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-network\fR] [\fB\-\-allow\-private\-network\fR] [\fB\-\-icon\-pack\fR] [\fB\-\-icon\-pack\-source\fR] [\fB\-\-suppress\-errors\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\-file\fR] [\fB\-t\fR|\fB\-\-theme\fR] [\fB\-\-runtime\fR] [\fB\-\-system\-clock\fR] [\fB\-\-system\-timezone\fR] [\fB\-\-system\-random\fR] [\fB\-\-system\-timing\fR] [\fB\-\-fixed\-today\fR] [\fB\-\-fixed\-local\-offset\-minutes\fR] [\fB\-\-presentation\-profile\fR] [\fB\-\-text\-measurer\fR] [\fB\-\-math\-renderer\fR] [\fB\-w\fR|\fB\-\-width\fR] [\fB\-H\fR|\fB\-\-height\fR] [\fB\-I\fR|\fB\-\-svg\-id\fR] [\fB\-\-hand\-drawn\-seed\fR] [\fB\-\-sequence\-mirror\-actors\fR] [\fB\-\-ascii\-charset\fR] [\fB\-\-ascii\-direction\fR] [\fB\-\-ascii\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-xychart\-vertical\-plot\-height\fR] [\fB\-\-xychart\-category\-band\-width\fR] [\fB\-\-xychart\-horizontal\-plot\-width\fR] [\fB\-\-ascii\-max\-grid\-cells\fR] [\fB\-\-resource\-profile\fR] [\fB\-\-resource\-limit\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIINPUT\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Render one Mermaid diagram with Merman\*(Aqs native interface
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fIINPUT\fR]
Input Mermaid file. Use `\-` for stdin
.SH "RENDER INPUT AND OUTPUT"
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR \fI<OUTPUT>\fR
Output file. Use `\-` for stdout
.TP
\fB\-\-input\-kind\fR \fI<INPUT_KIND>\fR
Interpret the input as Mermaid source or an existing SVG document
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
mermaid
.IP \(bu 2
svg
.RE
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
Output format. Defaults to the first compiled output format
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
svg
.IP \(bu 2
ascii
.IP \(bu 2
unicode
.IP \(bu 2
png
.IP \(bu 2
jpg
.IP \(bu 2
pdf
.RE
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress non\-error log output
.SH "MERMAN RENDERER CONTROLS"
.TP
\fB\-\-svg\-pipeline\fR \fI<SVG_PIPELINE>\fR
SVG output pipeline. Compiled binary exports always start from resvg\-safe
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
parity
.IP \(bu 2
readable
.IP \(bu 2
resvg\-safe
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-presentation\-profile\fR \fI<PRESENTATION_PROFILE>\fR
First\-party presentation profile applied below explicit Mermaid configuration
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
merman\-modern
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-text\-measurer\fR \fI<TEXT_MEASURER>\fR
Text measurement strategy
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
deterministic
.IP \(bu 2
vendored
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-math\-renderer\fR \fI<MATH_RENDERER>\fR
Math renderer override. Unspecified uses the compiled default; `ratex` requires `math`
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
none
.IP \(bu 2
ratex
.RE
.SH "SVG-BASED OUTPUT"
.TP
\fB\-b\fR, \fB\-\-background\fR \fI<BACKGROUND_COLOR>\fR
Background color for the selected rendered output
.SH "MERMAID CONFIGURATION"
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-css\-file\fR \fI<CSS_FILE>\fR
CSS file injected into SVG output before export
.TP
\fB\-\-suppress\-errors\fR
Emit an error diagram instead of failing on parse errors
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\-file\fR \fI<CONFIG_FILE>\fR
JSON Mermaid configuration file
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-theme\fR \fI<THEME>\fR
Mermaid theme override
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
default
.IP \(bu 2
base
.IP \(bu 2
dark
.IP \(bu 2
forest
.IP \(bu 2
neutral
.IP \(bu 2
neo
.IP \(bu 2
neo\-dark
.IP \(bu 2
redux
.IP \(bu 2
redux\-dark
.IP \(bu 2
redux\-color
.IP \(bu 2
redux\-dark\-color
.RE
.SH "RASTER OUTPUT"
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-scale\fR \fI<SCALE>\fR
Raster output scale factor. Defaults to 1
.SH "MERMAN RASTER CONTROLS"
.TP
\fB\-\-raster\-fit\-width\fR \fI<RASTER_FIT_WIDTH>\fR
Fit raster output to this CSS\-pixel width before applying \-\-scale
.TP
\fB\-\-raster\-fit\-height\fR \fI<RASTER_FIT_HEIGHT>\fR
Fit raster output to this CSS\-pixel height before applying \-\-scale
.TP
\fB\-\-raster\-max\-width\fR \fI<RASTER_MAX_WIDTH>\fR
Maximum raster output width after scale and fit. Defaults to 4096
.TP
\fB\-\-raster\-max\-height\fR \fI<RASTER_MAX_HEIGHT>\fR
Maximum raster output height after scale and fit. Defaults to 4096
.TP
\fB\-\-raster\-max\-pixels\fR \fI<RASTER_MAX_PIXELS>\fR
Maximum raster output pixels after scale and fit. Defaults to 4096*4096
.TP
\fB\-\-raster\-unbounded\fR
Disable raster size limits. Use only for trusted oversized exports
.SH "MERMAN PDF CONTROLS"
.TP
\fB\-\-pdf\-filter\-scale\fR \fI<FILTER_SCALE>\fR
Sampling scale for SVG filters that require localized PDF bitmaps. Defaults to 4
.TP
\fB\-\-pdf\-max\-filter\-image\-pixels\fR \fI<MAX_FILTER_IMAGE_PIXELS>\fR
Maximum aggregate pixels retained as localized PDF filter images. Defaults to 33554432
.TP
\fB\-\-pdf\-filter\-images\-unbounded\fR
Disable the retained PDF filter\-image pixel budget for trusted inputs
.SH "MERMAN EMBEDDED-IMAGE CONTROLS"
.TP
\fB\-\-embedded\-image\-max\-bytes\fR \fI<MAX_IMAGE_BYTES>\fR
Maximum decoded data\-URL bytes for one embedded image. Defaults to 16777216
.TP
\fB\-\-embedded\-image\-max\-total\-bytes\fR \fI<MAX_TOTAL_BYTES>\fR
Maximum aggregate decoded data\-URL bytes for embedded images. Defaults to 33554432
.TP
\fB\-\-embedded\-image\-max\-pixels\fR \fI<MAX_IMAGE_PIXELS>\fR
Maximum intrinsic pixels for one embedded raster image. Defaults to 16777216
.TP
\fB\-\-embedded\-image\-max\-total\-pixels\fR \fI<MAX_TOTAL_PIXELS>\fR
Maximum aggregate intrinsic pixels for embedded raster images. Defaults to 33554432
.TP
\fB\-\-embedded\-images\-unbounded\fR
Disable embedded raster image decode budgets for trusted inputs
.SH "ICON PACKS"
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-network\fR
Allow icon pack loading from public HTTP(S) destinations
.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-private\-network\fR
Allow explicitly configured icon URLs to resolve to private or loopback addresses
.TP
\fB\-\-icon\-pack\fR \fI<PACKAGE_OR_PATH>\fR
Iconify package name or local package path. Can be repeated
.TP
\fB\-\-icon\-pack\-source\fR \fI<PREFIX#SOURCE>\fR
Iconify prefix and source as PREFIX#SOURCE. Can be repeated
.SH "RUNTIME POLICY"
.TP
\fB\-\-runtime\fR \fI<POLICY>\fR [default: deterministic]
Runtime source for clock, local timezone, and operation randomness
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
deterministic
.IP \(bu 2
native
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-system\-clock\fR
Use the system clock while keeping other runtime sources deterministic
.TP
\fB\-\-system\-timezone\fR
Use the system local timezone while keeping other runtime sources deterministic
.TP
\fB\-\-system\-random\fR
Use system randomness while keeping other runtime sources deterministic
.TP
\fB\-\-system\-timing\fR
Enable operation timing diagnostics through the compiled system timing adapter
.TP
\fB\-\-fixed\-today\fR \fI<FIXED_TODAY>\fR
Override the local "today" date for time\-dependent diagrams
.TP
\fB\-\-fixed\-local\-offset\-minutes\fR \fI<FIXED_LOCAL_OFFSET_MINUTES>\fR
Override the local timezone offset in minutes for time\-dependent diagrams
.SH "LAYOUT VIEWPORT"
.TP
\fB\-w\fR, \fB\-\-width\fR \fI<CONTAINER_WIDTH>\fR
Available container width for size\-sensitive layouts
.TP
\fB\-H\fR, \fB\-\-height\fR \fI<CONTAINER_HEIGHT>\fR
Available container height for size\-sensitive layouts
.SH "SVG OUTPUT"
.TP
\fB\-I\fR, \fB\-\-svg\-id\fR \fI<SVG_ID>\fR
Root SVG id and internal marker prefix
.SH "DETERMINISTIC RENDERING"
.TP
\fB\-\-hand\-drawn\-seed\fR \fI<HAND_DRAWN_SEED>\fR
Stabilize rough/hand\-drawn rendering where supported
.SH "TEXT OUTPUT"
.TP
\fB\-\-sequence\-mirror\-actors\fR
Mirror sequence participants below lifelines for ASCII/Unicode output
.TP
\fB\-\-ascii\-charset\fR \fI<ASCII_CHARSET>\fR
Override the text renderer character set
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
ascii
.IP \(bu 2
unicode
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-ascii\-direction\fR \fI<ASCII_DIRECTION>\fR
Override the default graph direction when Mermaid input omits one
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
left\-right
.IP \(bu 2
top\-down
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-ascii\-color\fR \fI<ASCII_COLOR>\fR
Color mode for terminal text output
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
plain
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
ansi16
.IP \(bu 2
ansi256
.IP \(bu 2
truecolor
.IP \(bu 2
html
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-xychart\-vertical\-plot\-height\fR \fI<XYCHART_VERTICAL_PLOT_HEIGHT>\fR
XYChart vertical plot height for text output
.TP
\fB\-\-xychart\-category\-band\-width\fR \fI<XYCHART_CATEGORY_BAND_WIDTH>\fR
XYChart category band width for text output
.TP
\fB\-\-xychart\-horizontal\-plot\-width\fR \fI<XYCHART_HORIZONTAL_PLOT_WIDTH>\fR
XYChart horizontal plot width for text output
.TP
\fB\-\-ascii\-max\-grid\-cells\fR \fI<ASCII_MAX_GRID_CELLS>\fR
Maximum graph grid cells for text route planning
.SH "RESOURCE CONTROLS"
.TP
\fB\-\-resource\-profile\fR \fI<PROFILE>\fR [default: trusted\-native]
Resource policy for input, semantic models, output, and CLI acquisition.

Use interactive for cooperative editor\-like workloads, constrained for untrusted or multi\-tenant input, and trusted\-native for controlled local workloads. The unbounded profile retains hard implementation and protocol guards.
.sp
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
interactive: General interactive applications and public binding surfaces
.IP \(bu 2
constrained: Constrained rendering for untrusted or publicly submitted documents
.IP \(bu 2
trusted\-native: Local CLI and controlled native batch rendering
.IP \(bu 2
unbounded\-for\-trusted\-input: Explicitly disable policy budgets while retaining hard backend capabilities
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-resource\-limit\fR \fI<STABLE_ID=POSITIVE_U64>\fR
Override a resource budget as STABLE_ID=POSITIVE_U64. Can be repeated
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  merman\-cli render diagram.mmd

More options: `merman\-cli render \-\-help` shows advanced renderer, resource, and security controls.
.SH VERSION
v0.8.0\-alpha.5
